{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-21 05:45:00', 'title': 'MTCH ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MAY 5, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF MATCH GROUP, INC. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF MATCH GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: MTCH) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED MATCH COMMON STOCK BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021, THROUGH JANUARY 31, 2023.LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: MAY 5, 2023 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}